{
  "meta": {
    "title": "Colorado Qualified Opportunity Zones designated for the 2027 round",
    "source": "U.S. Treasury final designations, via the CDFI Fund Opportunity Zones page (spreadsheet sheet final_oz2_designations, Colorado rows)",
    "source_url": "https://www.cdfifund.gov/media/8018881/download?inline",
    "url": "https://www.cdfifund.gov/opportunity-zones",
    "related_source_urls": [
      "https://home.treasury.gov/news/press-releases/sb0682/",
      "https://home.treasury.gov/policy-issues/tax-policy/data-transparency/qualified-opportunity-zones",
      "https://www.irs.gov/irb/2026-20_IRB"
    ],
    "source_quote": "Update November 5, 2026: Treasury has designated the list of Qualified Opportunity Zones for 2026.",
    "designated_on": "2026-11-05",
    "effective_date": "2027-01-01",
    "retrieved": "2026-11-10",
    "last_verified": "2026-11-10",
    "review_by": "2027-01-15",
    "tract_count": 91,
    "rural_count": 28,
    "county_count": 32,
    "zones_2018_count": 126,
    "same_tract_number_as_2018": 37,
    "geometry": null,
    "notes": [
      "The new zones run January 1, 2027 through December 31, 2036 (IRS IRB 2026-20: \"the QOZ designation period begins on January 1, 2027, and ends on December 31, 2036.\"). The 2018 zones in data/market/opportunity_zones_co.geojson stay designated through December 31, 2028, so both sets are in force in 2027 and 2028.",
      "Treasury lists tract numbers only. No boundaries are drawn yet, so the maps still show the 2018 zones.",
      "2018 zones use 2010 census tract numbers. same_tract_number_as_2018 counts matching numbers only. A matching number does not prove the boundaries are identical, and a non-matching number does not prove the area dropped out.",
      "Rural follows Treasury's 'Rural QOZ' column. Rural Qualified Opportunity Fund investments get the 30% five-year basis step-up under P.L. 119-21 section 70421.",
      "by_county lists all 64 Colorado counties. county_count (32) counts counties with at least one 2027 zone; 16 counties have no zone in either round and carry 0 for both."
    ],
    "designation_period": "2027-01-01 to 2036-12-31"
  },
